### Archify

Pinned Archify artifacts live under `04_analysis/personal/visualization/` (see `archify-version.yaml`; compiler zip alongside when present). Read-only visualization compiler only.

### Agentic Reviewer System (ARS) — topology inspiration only

Several `05_manuscript/qc/` and `06_review/qc/` checklists and `00_orchestrator/runtime-flow` note "Inspired by ARS… (no ARS copy)". Topology/checklist *structure* inspiration only; no ARS source text is copied into this pack.

### Mounted upstream packs

Bytes under local `mounts-cap/` (not always in git) keep their upstream licenses.
Registry sources: MedSci, Scientific, Nature, AIPOCH (non-base = default deny); live default = in-repo my-skills.
Do not re-license upstream pack text when syncing cache.

### Journal data

Curated JCR xlsx and personal submission priors live outside this public repo
(see `{doc_root}/04-lab-reference/` in `00_orchestrator/references/lab-paths.yaml`).
Redistribution of Clarivate-derived tables is the operator's responsibility.

